keywords:
  - AI safety
  - multilingual
  - over-refusal
  - activation steering
  - conformal prediction
  - Tiny Aya
abstract: >-
  An audit of whether refusal repair is language-fair on Cohere's Tiny Aya across ten languages in three
  resource tiers, built on the Lexsi stack (CuratorKIT, CircuitKIT, SafeTune, AuditKIT). Code is Apache-2.0;
  data and model outputs are CC-BY-NC-4.0 (inherited from Tiny Aya and NLLB).
